# Phase 18 Producer runtime backpressure/retry parity — 2026-10-13

- Starting revision: `c1475a78` on `phase/19-phase-18-compatibility-release-gate`; worktree was clean. The pinned Java source checkout was read-only and remains at commit `2238256de1d227a4384ba969dfa31473187b4d08` with its pre-existing untracked `broker/src/test/java/org/apache/rocketmq/broker/aaaa.java` preserved.
